mmunicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Let's Review Verbs with Infinitives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We can use verbs with Infinitives to talk about hobbies and interests.<br/><br/>Some verbs are followed by the <span class=\"strong\">Infinitive form</span> of another verb  (to + verb). Some verbs are:<br/><br/><li><span class=\"italic\">prefer - prefer to go, prefer to eat</span><br/><li><span class=\"italic\">hate - hate to leave, hate to see</span><br/><li><span class=\"italic\">like - like to see, like to get</span><br/><li><span class=\"italic\">need - need to sleep, need to buy</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I prefer to watch a Superman movie."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I like to collect comic books."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I need to take a photo with him!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I hate to wait in line."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making and Responding to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can make a request using these phrases: <br/><br /> <span class=\"italic\">Could you \u2026 ?</span><br/><span class=\"italic\">Can I \u2026 ?<br/>Could is more polite.<br/></span><br/>Review the chart:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Polite\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Polite</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Casual</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Making a Request</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you pass me that comic, please?<br/>Could you help me set this up?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can I see the back of that one?<br/> Can you hand me that book?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Responding to a Request</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes, of course.<br/>No, I'm sorry.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure. Here you go.<br/>No, sorry.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to text"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to send a text message to someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Text me later!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are the words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "autograph"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a signature of a famous person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want Michael Keaton's autograph."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to take a photo"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to use a camera and capture a picture of someone or something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to take a photo with Michael Keaton."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "exhibit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "display of art"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The comic book exhibits are fantastic."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "graphic novel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a novel that looks like a comic book"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Look at this graphic novel about Batman!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small, open store at a convention"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My work has a stand at the convention."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shift"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "period of time to work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have a morning or an evening shift."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to promise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to tell someone that you will definitely do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I promise to buy you lunch today."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob11aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [